<title>USA: Prestige Financial sets 6-for-5 split.</title>
<headline>Prestige Financial sets 6-for-5 split.</headline>
<dateline>FLEMINGTON, N.J. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prestige Financial Corp said its board has approved a six-for-five stock split, payable April 18, to shareholders of record on April 9.</p>
<p>The company also said its board has raised its quarterly dividend to $0.075 per share from $0.05, payable March 31, record March 20.</p>
</text>
